{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Golden set for the deterministic match safety gate (Phase 6 prompt-regression). Each case annotates a raw model output and the expected gated decision, so any change to the guard/gate logic or the threshold that alters behavior surfaces in CI. Cases run offline against the pure function apply_match_safety_gate (no model, no network).",
